flowchart TB
  cli[pick-model CLI] --> command{Task or closed command?}
  command -- closed --> validate[Validate harness and expiry]
  validate --> file[Read current closures / direct write]
  file --> out[JSON result / caller]
  command -- task --> inputs[Read closures / recorded Codex usage / credential]
  inputs --> models[Read 02 roles / ranking / model specs]
  models --> role[Jev role request / 60s]
  role --> candidates[Role candidates minus closed harnesses]
  candidates --> pick[Jev candidate request / 60s]
  pick --> out
  inputs -. failure .-> error[stderr / exit 2 / no completed choice]
  models -. failure .-> error
  role -. failure or no candidates .-> error
  pick -. failure .-> error
  out --> note[No child spawn / no model application]
